    "body": "Guix release binaries use GCC's POSIX thread model, but the pinned Nixpkgs compiler defaults to mcf.\r\n\r\nOverriding `threadsCross` on `gcc14.cc` does not recompute its already-instantiated configure flags, and leaves wrapper dependency handling tied to `targetPackages.threads`.\r\n\r\nTherefore here we instead replace the existing `--enable-threads` flag directly, and clear the target and wrapper extra-package dependencies.\r\n\r\n- `extraPackages = [ ]` stops the wrapper from adding `mcfgthread` include/library paths or link dependencies.\r\n- `depsTargetTarget = [ ]` removes `mcfgthread` from GCC’s target-side build dependencies.\r\n\r\nFixes: #36314",
